sub,lercd101,"Dutch Lerchen",0,5,6
com,"$Game was delayed for 20 minutes while umpire Perrine"
com,"waited for crowd to be silent so he could announce"
com,"Lerchen entering game. St. Louis crowd booed umpire"
com,"and made lots of noise to show their displeasure"
com,"with umpire's work during double-header (particularly"
com,"calling Wagner safe at home in top of inning). Both"
com,"managers and Browns management pleaded with umpire"
com,"to continue game but he refused. Finally only when"
com,"Browns owner Robert Hedges had a word with him did"
com,"the umpire allow the game to continue."
